Note on upstream data: this tracker aggregates publicly-issued forecasts
from NOAA CPC, IRI, BoM, ECMWF, and reanalysis from NOAA OISST and
ECMWF ERA5. The upstream data is not covered by this license and retains
its respective publishers' terms. This license covers only the
aggregation, methodology, prose, charts, and code in this repository.
